---
source: crates/news/tests/cli.rs
expression: "stdout_of(&[\"run\", \"--help\"])"
---
Chief: preset runs and their status (read-only; Board starts and controls runs)

Usage: news run [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  presets  The preset catalogue
  status   The status board, or one run
  lineup   The Lineup: heavy runs waiting for the slot
  list     Recent runs
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --limit <N>        Return at most N list items (default 20; `jobs claim`: how many to claim, default 1)
      --fields <A,B>     Keep only these keys of each item, comma-separated
      --cursor <CURSOR>  Continue a truncated list from its next_cursor
  -h, --help             Print help
